/*  CONSTANT NAME:      _dirVert
    DESCRIPTION:*//**The 2 scalar position-deltas for the vertical directions, as a vertical array in canonical clockwise order from north (up, down) matching _arrowsVert. Each is a single integer to add to a TOPOS position (row ±1, i.e. ∓_mult; derived from _mult).*/
/*  REVISIONS:          Date        Developer   Description
                        2026-06-19  Claude      Initial version
                        2026-08-20  Claude      Canonical order is now clockwise from north (= SORT order of _arrowsAll)
                        2026-11-06  Claude      Derived from _mult instead of a literal 100000 (#380)
*/
_dirVert = _mult * {-1;1};
